# Normalise line endings. The repo is authored on Windows and run on Linux
# (Codespaces, CI), so without this the checkouts disagree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts MUST be LF. scripts/update-course-content.sh runs as the
# devcontainer's postAttachCommand inside a Linux container: with CRLF the
# shebang line ends in \r and the kernel reports "bad interpreter", which
# surfaces to a student as their Codespace failing to open properly.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets git must not try to normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
